{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03196","headline":"和石侍御山庄 · 杨炯","name":"和石侍御山庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟霞非俗宇，岩壑只幽居。\n水浸何曾畎，荒郊不复锄。\n影浓山树密，香浅泽花疎。\n阔堑防斜径，平堤夹小渠。\n莲房若个实，竹节几重虚。\n萧然隔城市，酌醴焚枯鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}